  nights:
  - title: First Flight
    memo: 'MEMO from Marketing: Welcome to the night shift, rookie. Hold Throw to
      wind up, let go to fly. Dive for speed, climb to slow down. Bring it down gently
      on the coffee mug.'
    mode: 0
    killTarget: 0
    maxRivals: 0
    timeLimit: 0
    windScale: 1
    noPencils: 0
    twoStarTime: 20
    threeStarTime: 12
    rewardClips: 30
    rewardUnlockId: 
  - title: The Ring Route
    memo: 'MEMO: The sticky-note rings mark our patrol route. Ride the laptop''s
      heat to climb, boost when you need speed, and finish on the mug.'
    mode: 1
    killTarget: 0
    maxRivals: 0
    timeLimit: 0
    windScale: 1
    noPencils: 0
    twoStarTime: 70
    threeStarTime: 50
    rewardClips: 40
    rewardUnlockId: 
  - title: Trespasser
    memo: 'MEMO: One of Accounting''s planes is snooping round our desks. It keeps
      coming back for more, so shoot it down twice. Supply is sending you a bigger
      staple magazine.'
    mode: 2
    killTarget: 2
    maxRivals: 1
    timeLimit: 0
    windScale: 1
    noPencils: 0
    twoStarTime: 60
    threeStarTime: 35
    rewardClips: 20
    rewardUnlockId: staples_plus
  - title: Rough Air
    memo: 'MEMO: Someone set every fan and vent to MAX. Fly the ring route anyway.
      The air pushes harder tonight, so use it, don''t fight it.'
    mode: 1
    killTarget: 0
    maxRivals: 0
    timeLimit: 120
    windScale: 1.6
    noPencils: 0
    twoStarTime: 80
    threeStarTime: 60
    rewardClips: 50
    rewardUnlockId: 
  - title: Pencil Pushers
    memo: 'MEMO: Accounting is out in force. Down four of them and we''ll requisition
      you a pair of lock-on pencil missiles.'
    mode: 2
    killTarget: 4
    maxRivals: 0
    timeLimit: 0
    windScale: 1
    noPencils: 0
    twoStarTime: 110
    threeStarTime: 75
    rewardClips: 20
    rewardUnlockId: pencils
  - title: Against the Clock
    memo: 'MEMO: The cleaners come at dawn. Run the whole route and land in under
      a minute. Do it and R&D will teach you the Glider fold.'
    mode: 1
    killTarget: 0
    maxRivals: 0
    timeLimit: 60
    windScale: 1
    noPencils: 0
    twoStarTime: 50
    threeStarTime: 40
    rewardClips: 30
    rewardUnlockId: fold_glider
  - title: Backup
    memo: 'MEMO: You''re not alone any more. Two Marketing wingmen fly with you tonight.
      Together, down six of Accounting''s planes.'
    mode: 4
    killTarget: 6
    maxRivals: 0
    timeLimit: 0
    windScale: 1
    noPencils: 0
    twoStarTime: 130
    threeStarTime: 90
    rewardClips: 60
    rewardUnlockId: 
  - title: Staples Only
    memo: 'MEMO: Pencil audit tonight, so they stay in the drawer. Five kills with
      staples alone, before the clock runs out. Survive it and you get the heavy
      paper.'
    mode: 2
    killTarget: 5
    maxRivals: 0
    timeLimit: 160
    windScale: 1
    noPencils: 1
    twoStarTime: 120
    threeStarTime: 85
    rewardClips: 30
    rewardUnlockId: paper_tough
  - title: Full Squadron
    memo: 'MEMO: Accounting''s whole squadron is up, and the air is rough. Ten kills
      between you and your wingmen takes the office back.'
    mode: 4
    killTarget: 10
    maxRivals: 0
    timeLimit: 0
    windScale: 1.3
    noPencils: 0
    twoStarTime: 190
